# Vendored third-party source: odo-miner

These files are a vendored subset of the upstream `odo-miner` project, which is
the basis for this Cyclone V SoC port's OdoCrypt algorithm and per-epoch RTL.

- Upstream:       https://github.com/MentalCollatz/odo-miner
- Pinned commit:  fb1bd94892e3b1893bfc2439ebec877b25856b18 (heads/master)
- Vendored on:    2026-06-27
- Scope:          only the subset this repo builds against — `src/crypto/`
                  (the OdoCrypt + Keccak reference) and `src/verilog/`
                  (`odo_gen`, the per-epoch RTL generator). The rest of upstream
                  (other board projects, the pool/miner host code) is NOT vendored.

## Per-file licensing

The upstream project as a whole is **GPL-3.0-or-later** (see LICENSE in this
directory). Individual files carry their own headers, which govern:

