`odo_gen` is a build-time tool: it emits Verilog (`odo_<epoch>.v`) consumed by
the FPGA build. The MIT and CC0 files are vendored under their permissive terms;
the GPL files are vendored under the GPL, and this repository as a whole is
distributed under GPL-3.0-or-later (see the top-level LICENSE) to remain
compliant, since the FPGA core is derived from upstream's GPL RTL.

Original license headers in each file are preserved verbatim and must not be
removed. `src/crypto/COPYING` is the upstream MIT text for the crypto subtree.
